{"connection_id": "BC-57422d64a702922d1b0b", "ref": "SBLGNT:Rev.14.13", "target": "sec13", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "deeds follow the dead", "note": "The commentary says what people have done is present at judgment; Revelation blesses those who die in the Lord and says their deeds follow them, making work accompany a person beyond death."}
{"connection_id": "BC-17256436da819baa3033", "ref": "SBLGNT:Rev.14.13", "target": "sec13", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "deeds follow the dead", "note": "A voice says those who die in the Lord rest from labors and their works follow them; this closely meets the commentary's time limit, enduring good works, and deeds present afterward."}
