{"connection_id": "BC-8ee73fbfc656d5c5a239", "ref": "SBLGNT:Rev.20.12", "target": "sec13", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "dead judged by written deeds", "note": "The commentary says what people did is present at judgment; Revelation shows the dead before the throne, books opened, and judgment according to what is written of their deeds."}
